Debug mode on a directory skips its unsupported `raw.txt` without an error and prints the Markdown files `a.md` and `c.md` in path order.
== args
--debug
input/mixed
== file input/mixed/c.md
# c
== file input/mixed/a.md
# a
== file input/mixed/raw.txt
plain text
== stdout
\x1b[32m# a\x1b[0m

\x1b[32m# c\x1b[0m
== stderr
== exit 0
